# 统一换行与二进制识别，避免不同平台提交时产生整文件换行变更。

# 默认按文本处理，工作区统一 LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 固件与图片按二进制处理，不做换行转换
*.gif  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.bin  binary
*.hex  binary
*.elf  binary
*.axf  binary
*.su   binary
*.o    binary
*.obj  binary
*.a    binary
*.lib  binary
*.exe  binary
